  "question_stem": "A particle $A$, moving along a straight horizontal track with constant speed $8 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$, passes a fixed point $O$. Four seconds later, another particle $B$ passes $O$, moving along a parallel track in the same direction as $A$. Particle $B$ has speed $20 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$ when it passes $O$ and has a constant deceleration of $2 \\text{ m s}^{-2}$. $B$ comes to rest when it returns to $O$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "$s_A=8(t+4)=32+8t$ and $s_B=20t-t^2$",
    "$t=4\\,\\mathrm{s}$ and $t=8\\,\\mathrm{s}$"
  ],
